WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.990
Three money rules I wish someone told me at 22.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.840
Rule one: pay yourself first.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:08.620
Before rent, before anything.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.340
Rule two: if you can't buy it twice, you can't afford it.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.520
Yeah, that one hurt.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.900
Rule three: automate it.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:22.190
Set it up once and you never have to think about it, think about it again.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.650
Save this for payday and follow for more money tips.
